<title>FRANCE: Alcatel wins Singapore data contract.</title>
<headline>Alcatel wins Singapore data contract.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Telecom, a unit of engineering group Alcatel Alsthom, said on Monday it has won a contract from Singapore Telecom to supply high-speed data access equipment for its fast Internet trial.</p>
<p>The contract is for the supply of Asymmetrical Digital Subscriber Line (ASDL) equipment which will allow high speed Internet and video services on the island's SingNet, Alcatel Telecom said in a statement.</p>
<p>It gave no financial details.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 pnt</p>
</text>
